  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Laplace’s Demon — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>At 18th level you have mastered your technique allowing you to expand your domain. At initiative 20, all creatures of your choice within your domain gain a cumulative -2 penalty to all rolls against you as you begin to see the state of every atom.<br />\n While inside the domain:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>You know the hit points, cursed energy, effects, conditions, resistances, immunities, and vulnerabilities of all creatures within the domain.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Invisible creatures are always visible to you.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Creatures cannot gain advantage against you from being unseen or hidden.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
